# The quiver on the right hip (graphics/mesh/quiver, docs/manual-aim.md): it hangs from a ring on the pelvis and
# swings; the right leg, arm and the armour's flaps push it aside. The hero and an npc bowman in five armours
# (the bandit's thing on the hip, the militia's flaps, the fire mage's robe, the paladin's plate, light leather):
# walking and running with the bow put away, running with the bow (S_BOWRUNL), a sudden stop, turning on the
# spot, the aim and the shot; standing with the bow, aiming crouched, sneaking; a two-hander on the back with
# the bow; 0, 1, 5, 20, 50 arrows. From in front on the right and from the right side. slowmo 2: a row of
# metrics.csv is 1/60 s of the game (qv_armor, qv_leg, qv_arm: cm the armour, the legs, an arm go into the
# quiver; qv_swing/back/outward: deg from the rest; qv_mx..qv_mz: the mouth in the pelvis bone's frame; qv_us:
# the step's cost); a clip to 60 fps in real time: ffmpeg -i x.mp4 -vf setpts=0.5*PTS -r 60 x60.mp4.
# The quiver's body: OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT with ITRW_QUIVER (reports/content/2026-11-quiver)
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091   # flat open ground
face -106                         # a rock behind, open in front
wait 500
manual on
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
arrows player 20
insert Sheep
wait 300
pin SHEEP 1200 0 0
aimat SHEEP body
cam look 95
slowmo 2
tap bow
wait 1500

